## Control {{controlId}}: Monitor Security Controls on an Ongoing Basis

**Implementation Status:** {{status}}

This organization monitors and controls external system connections within the {{tenantName}} M365 GCC High tenant through cross-tenant access policies, guest access controls, and B2B collaboration restrictions managed by {{variables.systemAdministrator}}.

{{#if crossTenantPolicyConfigured}}
**Cross-Tenant Access Controls:**
Cross-tenant access policies restrict external system connections:
- Inbound access: External users from authorized partner tenants only, subject to MFA and compliance requirements
- Outbound access: Organizational users restricted from sharing CUI with unauthorized external tenants
- B2B collaboration limited to explicitly approved organizations
{{/if}}

{{#if conditionalAccessActive}}
**External User Enforcement:**
{{caPoliciesTotalCount}} Conditional Access policies enforce security requirements for external connections:
{{#each policies}}
- **{{displayName}}** ({{state}}): Requires {{#each grantControls.builtInControls}}{{this}}{{#unless @last}}, {{/unless}}{{/each}}
{{/each}}

Guest users and external collaborators are subject to the same MFA, device compliance, and session controls as internal users.
{{/if}}

{{#if organizationConfigured}}
**Organization Identity:**
Organization: **{{organizationName}}**
{{#if verifiedDomains}}Verified domains: {{#each verifiedDomains}}{{this}}{{#unless @last}}, {{/unless}}{{/each}}{{/if}}
{{/if}}

**Responsible Party:** {{variables.systemAdministrator}}

**Verification Method:** Examine cross-tenant access policies, guest access configurations, B2B collaboration settings, Conditional Access policies for external users, and external connection audit logs.

